<title>USA: Laifer group ups Styling Technology stake.</title>
<headline>Laifer group ups Styling Technology stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Lance Laifer and his Laifer Capital Management Inc said Wednesday that it raised its stake in Styling Technology Corp to 662,100 common shares, or 16.8 percent of the total outstanding, from 604,400 shares, or 15.3 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 57,700 Styling Technology shares between April 30 and May 15 at prices ranging from $9.375 to $10.25 each.</p>
